  "construction": "Bivariate bicycle code with l = 7, m = 5, x = S_7 (x) I_5, y = I_7 (x) S_5 (S the cyclic shift matrix), A = y^2 + x^2 + x^3 + x^4, B = y + x + x^3, H_X = [A | B], H_Z = [B^T | A^T]; code Q70 of Table XXX of arXiv:2604.19481 (Tripier et al., the Walking Cat architecture). Rebuilt here from those polynomials; n, k, and the check weight 7 reproduce the paper's values.",
