  "notes": "Literature baseline: a reproduction of code Q70 of arXiv:2604.19481 (Table XXX), not a new construction and not a new parameter set. Same parameters as 70-6-9, which reproduces a row of Lin and Pryadko's 2BGA database (July 2023), but a different code: each side of both codes has exactly 35 minimum-weight stabilizers, and nauty finds no isomorphism between the typed Tanner graphs on those complete sets, with or without an X/Z swap, so a signature match against 70-6-9 is two inequivalent codes with the same parameters. The paper reports d = 9; this entry carries witness-backed upper bounds from the board's own search until certified. Seeded after Nicolas Delfosse (IonQ) reported the code in review of the QEC Challenge paper.",
